OL,3,GNEWSATown's celebrated geese to get
OL,4,Atheir own shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's flock of geese which have been
OL,7,Fimmortalised in books and on calendars,
OL,8,Ftea towels and pin badges will soon
OL,9,Fhave another feather in their caps.
OL,11,FThe birds seen waddling around March in
OL,12,FCambridgeshire are set to be a key
OL,13,Ffeature of a new shop combining sweet
OL,14,Ftreats, tourist information and
OL,15,Fgoose-related gifts to raise funds for
OL,16,Fcharity.
OL,18,FChocolatier Chrissie Fadipe, who was
OL,19,Fbehind the gaggle's range of
OL,20,Fmerchandise, said she hoped The Geese
OL,21,Fof March Visitor and Gift Shop would
OL,22,Fopen before Christmas.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
